  "title": "Bacon and Chicken Foil Packets",
  "description": "Cooked in a tidy foil packet, chicken breasts are combined with bacon, potatoes, carrots, and onions for a complete meal. Perfect for the grill, campfire, or oven.",
  "authors": [
    "DEESOSA"
  ],
